&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MiniMax-M3&lt;/strong&gt;: Added support for the new &lt;strong&gt;MiniMax-M3&lt;/strong&gt; model (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4647355834&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45381&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45381/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45381&quot;&gt;#45381&lt;/a&gt;), with a fast follow-on of BF16/FP8 indexer via MSA (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4680019767&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45892&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45892/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45892&quot;&gt;#45892&lt;/a&gt;), MXFP4 support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4680317418&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45896&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45896/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45896&quot;&gt;#45896&lt;/a&gt;), FP8 sparse GQA (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4669482520&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45744&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45744/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45744&quot;&gt;#